@* FeedbackModal bridge: any PageModel may set TempData["SuccessMessage" | "ErrorMessage" | "WarningMessage" | "InfoMessage"]
   and the script block at the bottom of this layout will open a blocking FeedbackModal on page load.

   Optional companion keys (read by the same script block):
     TempData["ErrorDetail"]  - secondary text rendered in the modal's collapsible <details> panel.
     TempData["ErrorId"]      - request/correlation ID rendered monospace with a copy button. *@
